.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE OPTION REORDER"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute option reorder \- Set the complete option order, including retired options
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute option reorder [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the complete option order, including retired options
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ATTRIBUTE_KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --option-keys
Complete comma-separated sequence of stable option keys
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
